    <div class="faq-list reveal">
      <details>
        <summary>What kinds of parties does Lalasea host?</summary>
        <p>Lalasea advises on weddings, birthdays, family reunions, company parties and other events on request.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can the party menu be adjusted?</summary>
        <p>We can suggest a menu based on your guest numbers, needs and budget. <a href="{{ thongtin.zalo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message us on Zalo</a> to get the latest party menu.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does Lalasea have a stage?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Lalasea has a permanent stage facing the sea. Depending on your programme, the team will advise on using the existing stage or on any extra items you may need.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Are tables and chairs provided?</summary>
        <p>Lalasea has its own tables and chairs at the restaurant. The layout is planned with you according to the size and type of your party.</p>
      </details>
