        <summary>Can you host outdoor parties?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Lalasea has an outdoor seaside space suitable for many kinds of parties and events.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How far in advance should I book?</summary>
        <p>Preparation time depends on the size and requirements of each event. For weekends, public holidays or parties with lots to prepare, get in touch early so Lalasea can check availability.</p>
      </details>
